				<link>https://plant-idea.cc/congrats-to-feiyu-shurui-yanlin-yaru-and-zixin-on-their-graduation/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://plant-idea.cc/congrats-to-feiyu-shurui-yanlin-yaru-and-zixin-on-their-graduation/</guid>
				<description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and well done! Hope the future will bring you further success and a whole world of happiness!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=https://plant-idea.cc/posts/2026graduation/Figure1.jpg width=60% /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
