			<item>
				<title>New Lab members and new Lab name!</title>
				<link>https://plant-idea.cc/new-lab-members-and-new-lab-name/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://plant-idea.cc/new-lab-members-and-new-lab-name/</guid>
				<description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We warmly welcome &lt;strong&gt;Xuan&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Yi&lt;/strong&gt; to join us! We are aslo proud to announce that we have integrated our research directions and accordingly changed the name of our laboratory to &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Plant IDEA Lab&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plant IDEA Lab&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;Plant&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;nteractions, &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;esign, and &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;nvironmental &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;daptation&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>NutriNext 2025 Workshop</title>
